 d'installation",[376,377,378,391],"table",{},[379,380,381],"thead",{},[382,383,384,388],"tr",{},[385,386,387],"th",{},"Variable",[385,389,390],{},"Effet",[392,393,394,405,419,433,447,460],"tbody",{},[382,395,396,402],{},[397,398,399],"td",{},[223,400,401],{},"WOLF_URL",[397,403,404],{},"Le site Wolf central.",[382,406,407,412],{},[397,408,409],{},[223,410,411],{},"WOLF_TOKEN",[397,413,414,415,418],{},"Son jeton d'enregistrement (",[210,416,417],{},"Wolf Settings",").",[382,420,421,426],{},[397,422,423],{},[223,424,425],{},"WOLF_BENCHES",[397,427,428,429,432],{},"Chemins de benches séparés par des espaces, pour sauter la découverte automatique : ",[223,430,431],{},"\"\u002Fhome\u002Ffrappe\u002Ffrappe-bench \u002Fsrv\u002Fother-bench\"",".",[382,434,435,440],{},[397,436,437],{},[223,438,439],{},"WOLF_AGENT_SRC",[397,441,442,443,446],{},"Source pip : un répertoire local ou une URL ",[223,444,445],{},"git+https",". Par défaut : le répertoire du script, ou GitHub quand le script est lancé via curl.",[382,448,449,454],{},[397,450,451],{},[223,452,453],{},"WOLF_AGENT_REF",[397,455,456,457,432],{},"Référence Git pour une installation depuis GitHub. Par défaut ",[223,458,459],{},"main",[382,461,462,467],{},[397,463,464],{},[223,465,466],{},"WOLF_INSECURE=1",[397,468,469],{},"Désactive la vérification TLS pendant l'enregistrement et les envois (site Wolf avec certificat auto-signé).",[198,471,472,473,475,476,478],{},"Sans ",[223,474,401],{}," ni ",[223,477,411],{},", l'agent est installé mais pas enregistré. Enregistrez-le plus tard :",[215,480,482],{"className":217,"code":481,"filename":219,"language":220,"meta":221,"style":221},"sudo wolf-agent --config \u002Fetc\u002Fwolf-agent\u002Fconfig.json register --url https:\u002F\u002Fwolf.example.com --token \u003Ctoken>\nsudo chown wolf-agent: \u002Fetc\u002Fwolf-agent\u002Fconfig.json && sudo systemctl start wolf-agent\n",[223,483,484,520],{"__ignoreMap":221},[226,485,486,488,491,494,497,500,503,506,509,512,515,517],{"class":